{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930280/extras/2ff04c0b786fccb1c602dec4b440a54e.poster.avif?t=1756560076\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930280/extras/2ff04c0b786fccb1c602dec4b440a54e.webm?t=1756560076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930280/extras/2ff04c0b786fccb1c602dec4b440a54e.mp4?t=1756560076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feed the School! Chili Chaos</strong> is a fast-paced cooking sim with a fiery twist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the newly hired school chef, your job is to serve up tasty meals to hungry students, manage orders, and upgrade your kitchen to survive the growing lunchtime frenzy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there\u2019s a twist: spice things up by secretly slipping flaming hot chili peppers into the evil teachers\u2019 meals! <br>Take down the staff one spicy blast at a time\u2014and earn your title as a true lunchtime legend!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930280/extras/f7041d369d484dae84fa30ec68a6a54e.poster.avif?t=1756560076\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930280/extras/f7041d369d484dae84fa30ec68a6a54e.webm?t=1756560076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930280/extras/f7041d369d484dae84fa30ec68a6a54e.mp4?t=1756560076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic Cooking Fun</strong><br>Juggle cooking, plating, and serving in a fast-paced school kitchen that\u2019ll keep your adrenaline sizzling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kitchen Glow-up</strong><br>Unlock cool gadgets and tasty upgrades to serve faster, sharper, and spicier than ever.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn up the heat</strong><br>Supercharge your chilies to bring the burn! These spice levels will push every teacher to their limit!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Teacher Reactions</strong><br>Drop in those fiery chilies and brace yourself for hilarious, over-the-top teacher reactions!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Gameplay Loop</strong><br>Cook, serve, prank, upgrade\u2014and repeat. Every lunchtime gets spicier, sillier and more satisfying.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930280/extras/6f101cd5092aa29d0932fc91617c089c.poster.avif?t=1756560076\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930280/extras/6f101cd5092aa29d0932fc91617c089c.webm?t=1756560076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930280/extras/6f101cd5092aa29d0932fc91617c089c.mp4?t=1756560076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Makes 'Feed the School!' So Special?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pranks on the Menu</strong><br>This isn\u2019t your typical cooking game. It\u2019s a wild mix of kitchen chaos and spicy mischief!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Big Characters, Even Bigger Reactions</strong><br>Every teacher comes with a wild personality\u2014and even wilder meltdowns when the heat kicks in.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bring the Whole School to Its Knees</strong><br>Take down teachers one spicy blast at a time\u2014until no one\u2019s left standing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of <strong><i>Bash the Teacher</i></strong> will recognise some familiar teachers and the same chaotic school setting\u2014only this time, the madness moves to the cafeteria!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Class Dismissed!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feed the School! Chili Chaos</strong> is the most deliciously unhinged cooking game you\u2019ll ever play. So fire up the grill, load up on chilies, and smash that Wishlist button\u2014the lunchtime revolution starts now!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3930280?t=1756560076","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3930280?t=1756560076","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930280/31e17ca31090897999fb569c5d49460bfeaa0610/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756560076","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930280/31e17ca31090897999fb569c5d49460bfeaa0610/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756560076","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930280/extras/2ff04c0b786fccb1c602dec4b440a54e.poster.avif?t=1756560076\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930280/extras/2ff04c0b786fccb1c602dec