ers and the same chaotic school setting\u2014only this time, the madness moves to the cafeteria!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Class Dismissed!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feed the School! Chili Chaos</strong> is the most deliciously unhinged cooking game you\u2019ll ever play. So fire up the grill, load up on chilies, and smash that Wishlist button\u2014the lunchtime revolution starts now!</p>","developers":["Paul Banks"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930280/e1a9e623c15bcafa1f678f14bce6fc394f9dd11d/header.jpg?t=1756560076","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Feed the School! \u00a9 2025 PHB Media LTD.<br />\r\nAll rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3930280/326974224/994cca5fa1d2f83b3a566c51789026607ecb1275/1755696497/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756142335","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3930280/326974224/994cca5fa1d2f83b3a566c51789026607ecb1275/1755696497/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756142335","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3930280/326974224/994cca5fa1d2f83b3a566c51789026607ecb1275/1755696497/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1756142335","id":257186057,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257186057/movie480.mp4?t=1756142335","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257186057/movie_max.mp4?t=1756142335"},"name":"Feed the School! Announce Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257186057/bab3639a18278c55fabaf0b3f5e00ab0f87016dd/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756142335","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257186057/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1756142335","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstat